 TV all day,’ and then proceeded to win an Oscar for a role in a movie about *other* moms. Karma’s a mom too.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Angela Merkel\",\n      \"nickname\": \"The Chancellor Who Also Parented Like a Boss\",\n      \"claim_to_fame\": \"First female Chancellor of Germany, led through financial crises and pandemics, and somehow had time to raise a daughter (Malu) while running a country. Also, she’s fluent in five languages—her kids must’ve been *bilingual* by age 3.\",\n      \"mom_energy\": \"Calm, strategic, and probably had a ‘no tantrums’ policy that extended to world leaders.\",\n      \"fun_fact\": \"She once joked that her secret to leadership was ‘not giving up’—her daughter probably heard that *a lot* growing up.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"P.Diddy (Sean Combs)\",\n      \"nickname\": \"The Mompreneur of the Hip-Hop Scene\",\n      \"claim_to_fame\": \"Raised two kids (Christian and Justin) while building a billion-dollar empire, producing hits, and somehow finding time to be a fashion mogul. Also, he might’ve invented ‘dad jokes with a side of platinum records.’\",\n      \"mom_energy\": \"Lavish, high-energy, and probably has a ‘no bedtime’ rule (for adults *and* kids).\",\n      \"fun_fact\": \"He once sent Christian to boarding school in Switzerland and still managed to make it sound like a flex. ‘Investment in their future,’ he’d say.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"bonus_vibe\": \"These moms are out here ruling kingdoms, industries, and diaper changes like it’s nothing. 👑🎤🇩🇪💎\"\n}\n```", "logprobs": [{"token": "```", "logprob": -0.0015779199311509728}, {"token": "json", "logprob": -0.000296310376143083}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.012116285040974617}, {"token": "{\n", "logprob": -0.00340323057025671}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.00635874830186367}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.004179908894002438}, {"token": "f", "logprob": -0.45005500316619873}, {"token": "amous", "logprob": -0.09428425878286362}, {"token": "_m", "logprob": 